   "sec": 21.04,
   "heard": "UPSC, twenty-twenty-four. General Studies Paper Two, fifteen marks, two hundred and fifty words. Explain why privacy sits under Article twenty-one. Then discuss the law on a DNA test of a child in the womb, to prove paternity. Here is the strange part. We found no Supreme Court ruling on that second half."
